Expose only the temporary-directory API on x86_64 AROS ABIv1. The
stock CRT implements O_EXCL with separate lookup and creation, and
DOS has no qualified open-file unlink or atomic replacement contract.
A newly created temporary directory is the staging unit on this ABI.

